Current limitations

The map is a custom visual demo, not a real GPS map.
Cart locations are sample data and do not update live.
Follow state exists only while the app is running.
No login, registration, or real user accounts.
Customer, owner, and admin roles are only UI previews.
Cart owners cannot yet upload photos or publish real schedules.
No backend database.
No push notifications.
No actual 3 km geofence alerts.
Admin cannot really block or manage users.
No real location permissions or background tracking.
iOS scaffolding exists, but iOS build testing requires macOS/Xcode.
So this is a functional front-end demo, not yet a production-ready app. The next major step is adding a backend, authentication, real maps/GPS, photo storage, and push notifications.

